Derivations from third-party Apache License 2.0 software
================================================================

Some F-Pulse connectors and node implementations have been derived
from logic in other Apache License 2.0 OSS projects. Each entry
below records:

  * The F-Pulse component (manifest path or node module)
  * The upstream project + commit hash the logic was read from
  * Which aspects were ported (auth, pagination, error map, etc.)
  * Confirmation that the upstream component was Apache 2.0 at
    the cited commit (we pin to a specific revision because some
    repos changed terms after acquisition / re-licensing)

This is required by Apache 2.0 Section 4(b) when redistributing
derivative works. Adding an entry here is the final step of the
porting process documented in
docs/extend/derive-from-talend.md.

